{{Quote | ''Crystals shimmer all around!''}}

Crystal Cave is a special field in Pokémon Inritum.

It's active in the Crystal Cave area of Zapffe Falls Cave Depths.

==General Effects==

*'''All Rock Moves''': Power increased by 20%.
*'''All Fairy Moves''': Power increased by 20%.

==Moves Affected==

===Light-Based Moves===

*'''Power Gem, Dazzling Gleam''': Power increased by 30%.
*'''Flash Cannon, Aurora Beam''': Power increased by 20%.
*'''Prismatic Laser''': Power increased by 30%.
*'''Light Screen, Reflect''': Effect strengthened by 10%.

===Rock-Type Moves===

*'''Diamond Storm''': Power increased by 30%.
*'''Ancient Power''': Power increased by 20%.
*'''Rock Slide, Stone Edge''': Power increased by 10%.
*'''Stealth Rock''': Power increased by 10%, type changed to Fairy.

===Other Effects===

*'''Power Gem, Diamond Storm''': Increased critical hit rate.

